 travail qui a du sens pour soi...\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-68fb690 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"68fb690\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00c0 l&rsquo;instar de tout projet d\u2019orientation, votre projet de reconversion ou de r\u00e9orientation se doit d\u2019\u00eatre pr\u00e9par\u00e9 et m\u00fbrement r\u00e9fl\u00e9chi .<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0dc4772 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"0dc4772\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ebc3fab e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ebc3fab\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-25aca38 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"25aca38\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Comment pr\u00e9parer son projet de reconversion professionnelle ?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ca3d6b5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ca3d6b5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Votre projet de r\u00e9orientation et de reconversion professionnelle se doit d\u2019\u00eatre bien pens\u00e9. Et certains d\u00e9terminants sont \u00e0 prendre en compte avant d\u2019entamer quoi que ce soit. Voici quelques \u00e9tapes pour vous aider \u00e0 amorcer votre reconversion<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f9cc815 elementor-widget elementor-widget-toggle\" data-id=\"f9cc815\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"toggle.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-toggle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-toggle-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-2611\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2611\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-toggle-icon elementor-toggle-icon-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-toggle-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-caret-right\"><\/i><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-toggle-icon-opened\"><i class=\"elementor-toggle-icon-opened fas fa-caret-up\"><\/i><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-toggle-title\" tabindex=\"0\">1. Analyser la situation \u200b<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2611\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2611\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Faire une analyse de la situation. Faites une introspection et posez vous les bonnes questions. Pourquoi je souhaite me reconvertir par exemple ? A quoi j\u2019aspire \u00e0 travers cette reconversion ? Un test de personnalit\u00e9 et un test d\u2019orientation peuvent vous aider \u00e0 mieux vous conna\u00eetre.<\/span><\/p><p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-17232 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/Analyser-la-situation-professionel-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/Analyser-la-situation-professionel-2.png 300w, https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/Analyser-la-situation-professionel-2-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-toggle-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-2612\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2612\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-toggle-icon elementor-toggle-icon-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-toggle-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-caret-right\"><\/i><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-toggle-icon-opened\"><i class=\"elementor-toggle-icon-opened fas fa-caret-up\"><\/i><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-toggle-title\" tabindex=\"0\">  2. R\u00e9aliser un bilan de ses comp\u00e9tences professionnelles\u200b<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2612\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2612\"><p>R\u00e9alisez un bilan de votre carri\u00e8re professionnelle. Faites ressortir vos forces et faiblesses durant votre parcours. Sortez votre CV. Pensez \u00e0 ce que vous aurez am\u00e9lior\u00e9 par rapport \u00e0 vos comp\u00e9tences et au besoin de l\u2019entreprise ou encore du m\u00e9tier que vous exercer ou envisager d\u2019exercer.<\/p><p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-39683 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/Realiser-un-bilan-de-ses-competences-professionnelles-vf.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/Realiser-un-bilan-de-ses-competences-professionnelles-vf.jpg 400w, https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/Realiser-un-bilan-de-ses-competences-